entry.summary:
CREATE (Regular Deployment)
// Address = keccak256(deployer, nonce) new CreateContract(owner);
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── CREATE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Example: Deployer: 0x4f98e7507c578e2341B5b874E9a7C910aA8Db3e1 Nonce: 234 ────────────────────────────────────────────────────── Result: 0xa729B8363b472E8A3f20eF4E6210Cdd70C0cF5aB
Characteristics: ✅ Simple, default behavior ❌ Address changes if nonce changes ❌ Can't predict address before deployment ❌ Different address on each chain (different nonces)
